1
00:00:03,184 --> 00:00:07,873
Wherever the soft phone is present, a phone number field gets a dial button.

2
00:00:07,873 --> 00:00:11,703
Type a number in a user's phone number box, and a small phone

3
00:00:11,703 --> 00:00:13,476
button appears beside it.

4
00:00:13,476 --> 00:00:15,134
Fake numbers only here.

5
00:00:15,612 --> 00:00:19,652
Clicking it calls that number with the soft phone, and the same button

6
00:00:19,652 --> 00:00:21,672
appears on contact phone fields.

7
00:00:21,672 --> 00:00:24,012
An agent never has to retype a number.

